                        ["Voldin doth scheme endlessly in his cell, but what can come of it?"];
                    }
                } else {
                    ["To ease the burdens which Lady Yelinda must carry, the Great Captains assist her in ruling the city."];
                    ["Voldin be the eldest of the three Great Captains. They say he's a wise man, but I do not much care for him."];
                    ["Then there's Joth, an old sea-farin' man and a good customer of mine. But since he was hurt in the storms, he hath been a bit gruff."];
                    ["Captain Garth is the youngest of Lady Yelinda's advisors. He is always trailing some lady's skirts, that puppy!"];
