                    ["Arrogant people down there. Always wantin' ta beat thee. They have a big walled city south of here. Monitor is where the Pikemen are from."];
                    ["Larcenous bunch of armoured scum! They'll protect the roads for thee... if thou dost give them all thy money!"];
